"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">21</div><h1>화법 불변화사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Modalpartikeln</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 21의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 17 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">불변화사가 문장의 뜻이 아니라 말투를 바꾼다는 것을 알아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">부탁·권유·경고·허락에 맞게 mal·doch·bloß·ruhig를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">denn·eigentlich, ja·doch, eben·halt, schon·wohl의 말투를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">불변화사를 가운데 자리의 알맞은 곳에 놓아요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> (동료에게 가볍게 부탁) Mach <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Licht an!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) mal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ja</button></div><div class=\"qe\">가벼운 부탁의 '좀'은 mal이에요.<br>denn은 질문에, wohl은 추측에 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> (손님에게 앉으라고 권하며) Setzen Sie sich <span class=\"qblank\"></span>!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) doch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) eben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">권유의 '어서 ~하세요'는 doch예요.<br>재귀대명사 sich 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bloß&quot;,&quot;nur&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Fass <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(경고)</span> den Herd nicht an! Er ist heiß.</div><div class=\"qko\">절대 레인지 만지지 마! 뜨거워.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Fass <b>bloß</b> den Herd nicht an! Er ist heiß.</div>경고의 '절대'는 bloß예요. nur도 같은 뜻으로 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> (편하게 해도 된다고) Du darfst <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mein Fahrrad nehmen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) bloß</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ruhig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) denn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">허락의 '편하게 ~해도 돼'는 ruhig예요.<br>bloß는 경고, denn은 질문, wohl은 추측이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> (궁금해서) Wer ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Frau neben Jonas?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ruhig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) halt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) denn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">질문에 궁금한 마음을 더할 때는 denn이에요.<br>mal·halt·ruhig는 질문의 궁금함을 나타내지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wo hast du eigentlich Deutsch gelernt&quot;,&quot;Wo hast du Deutsch eigentlich gelernt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그런데 독일어는 어디서 배웠어?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">hast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Wo</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">eigentlich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Deutsch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">gelernt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wo hast du eigentlich Deutsch gelernt?</b></div>이야기하다 문득 묻는 '그런데'는 eigentlich예요.<br>불변화사는 동사·대명사 뒤, 명사 목적어 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ja&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Das Essen ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(놀람)</span> schon fertig!</div><div class=\"qko\">와, 밥이 벌써 다 됐네!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Essen ist <b>ja</b> schon fertig!</div>놀라움의 '-네!'는 ja예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> (둘 다 아는 사실) Am Montag ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Feiertag, also habe ich frei.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) bloß</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) ja</button></div><div class=\"qe\">상대도 아는 사실을 말할 때는 ja예요 — '월요일은 공휴일이잖아요'.<br>denn은 평서문에서 불변화사로 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> (체념) Der Zug fällt aus. Dann nehmen wir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ein Taxi.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) bloß</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) eben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ruhig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) denn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">바꿀 수 없는 일을 받아들일 때는 eben이에요. halt도 같은 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schon&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Mach dir keine Sorgen, du findest <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(안심)</span> eine Wohnung.</div><div class=\"qko\">걱정 마, 집은 꼭 구하게 될 거야.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mach dir keine Sorgen, du findest <b>schon</b> eine Wohnung.</div>안심시키는 '잘 될 거야'는 schon이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wohl&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Das Licht ist aus. Die Nachbarn sind <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(추측)</span> im Urlaub.</div><div class=\"qko\">불이 꺼져 있네요. 이웃들은 아마 휴가 중인가 봐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Licht ist aus. Die Nachbarn sind <b>wohl</b> im Urlaub.</div>'아마 ~인가 봐요' 정도의 추측은 wohl이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mal&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Ruf mich heute Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(가볍게 — '좀, 한번')</span> an!</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 저녁에 나한테 한번 전화 줘!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ruf mich heute Abend <b>mal</b> an!</div>가벼운 부탁은 mal이에요.<br>분리동사 anrufen의 an은 그대로 끝에 남아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;denn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Was hast du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(놀람·답답함이 담긴 질문)</span> gemacht? Deine Hose ist ganz nass!</div><div class=\"qko\">도대체 뭘 한 거야? 바지가 흠뻑 젖었잖아!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Was hast du <b>denn</b> gemacht? Deine Hose ist ganz nass!</div>질문에서 놀람이나 답답함을 나타낼 때는 denn이에요 — '도대체'.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;doch&quot;,&quot;ja&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Ich habe dir das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(상대를 일깨움 — '-잖아!')</span> schon dreimal erklärt!</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 그거 벌써 세 번이나 설명했잖아!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe dir das <b>doch</b> schon dreimal erklärt!</div>상대가 잊었다고 보고 일깨울 때는 doch예요.<br>ja도 문법상 맞지만, 답답해하며 일깨우는 말투는 doch예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ruhig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Probier <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(허락 — '편하게 ~해도 돼')</span> den Kuchen! Er ist nicht zu süß.</div><div class=\"qko\">케이크 편하게 먹어 봐! 너무 달지 않아.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Probier <b>ruhig</b> den Kuchen! Er ist nicht zu süß.</div>망설이는 상대에게 편하게 하라고 할 때는 ruhig예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Kommst du denn nicht mit&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너 같이 안 가?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">denn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Kommst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">du</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Kommst du denn nicht mit?</b></div>불변화사는 주어 뒤, 부정어 nicht 앞에 와요.<br>mit은 분리동사의 접두어라 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> (가볍게 부탁) Darf ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> dein Handy benutzen?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) halt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) mal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) eben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ja</button></div><div class=\"qe\">가벼운 부탁의 질문에도 mal을 넣어요.<br>ja·eben·halt는 질문에 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 불변화사 mal이 바른 자리에 있는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Zeig mir das mal Foto!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Mal zeig mir das Foto!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Zeig mal das mir Foto!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Zeig mir mal das Foto!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불변화사는 첫 자리에 오지 않아요.<br>대명사 mir 뒤, 명사 목적어 das Foto 앞에 놓아요. 관사와 명사 사이에는 들어가지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;eben&quot;,&quot;halt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich verstehe die Regel nicht. — Tja, Deutsch ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(바꿀 수 없는 사실)</span> schwer.</div><div class=\"qko\">규칙을 모르겠어. — 뭐, 독일어가 원래 어렵잖아.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich verstehe die Regel nicht. — Tja, Deutsch ist <b>eben</b> schwer.</div>어쩔 수 없는 사실을 말할 때는 eben·halt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Warum hast du mich denn nicht angerufen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">왜 나한테 전화 안 했어?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">hast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">denn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Warum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">angerufen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Warum hast du mich denn nicht angerufen?</b></div>불변화사 denn은 대명사(du · mich) 뒤, 부정어 nicht 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bloß&quot;,&quot;nur&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Vergiss <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(경고)</span> nicht, dass morgen die Prüfung ist!</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 시험이라는 거 절대 잊지 마!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Vergiss <b>bloß</b> nicht, dass morgen die Prüfung ist!</div>경고는 bloß·nur예요.<br>vergessen 뒤에 dass 문장이 이어져요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> (걱정하며) Bist du <span class=\"qblank\"></span> krank? Du siehst so blass aus.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mal</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ruhig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) halt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) denn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">걱정하거나 궁금해하며 묻는 질문에는 denn이에요.<br>Ja/Nein 질문에도 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;doch&quot;],[&quot;mal&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Komm <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(권유)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(가볍게)</span> vorbei, wenn du Zeit hast!</div><div class=\"qko\">시간 있으면 한번 들러!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Komm <b>doch</b> <b>mal</b> vorbei, wenn du Zeit hast!</div>친근한 권유는 doch mal이에요. 순서는 doch → mal이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> denn을 불변화사로 쓴 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er bleibt hier, denn es regnet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich gehe nach Hause, denn ich bin müde.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Wie spät ist es denn?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir kommen nicht, denn wir haben Besuch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불변화사 denn은 질문의 가운데 자리에 와요.<br>문장 사이의 denn은 '왜냐하면'이라는 접속사예요(19과).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ja&quot;,&quot;doch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Wir kennen uns <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(서로 아는 사실)</span> schon lange, also sag mir die Wahrheit.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 서로 오래 알았잖아, 그러니까 사실대로 말해 줘.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir kennen uns <b>ja</b> schon lange, also sag mir die Wahrheit.</div>둘 다 아는 사실을 말할 때는 ja예요. 일깨우는 말투로 doch도 돼요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> (친구가 약속을 잊은 것 같아서) Wir wollten <span class=\"qblank\"></span> heute zusammen kochen! Hast du das vergessen?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) doch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ja</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">상대가 잊었다고 보고 일깨우니 doch예요.<br>ja는 상대도 알고 있다고 볼 때 써요. 바로 뒤에 Hast du das vergessen?이 있어서 doch가 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 말하는 사람이 체념하고 있는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bleibst du denn zu Hause?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bleib bloß zu Hause!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Dann bleibe ich halt zu Hause.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bleib ruhig zu Hause.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halt는 '어쩔 수 없지'라는 체념이에요.<br>ruhig는 허락, bloß는 경고, denn은 궁금함이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;denn&quot;],[&quot;eben&quot;,&quot;halt&quot;],[&quot;doch&quot;],[&quot;ruhig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> A: Warum kommst du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(답답함이 담긴 질문)</span> so spät? Ich warte seit einer Stunde!<br>B: Entschuldige! Der Bus ist nicht gekommen. Das passiert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(어쩔 수 없음)</span> manchmal.<br>A: Schon gut. Komm, setz dich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(권유)</span>! Nimm dir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(허락)</span> noch einen Kaffee.</div><div class=\"qko\">A: 도대체 왜 이렇게 늦게 와? 한 시간째 기다리고 있어!<br>B: 미안해, 버스가 안 왔어. 그런 일은 가끔 있는 거잖아.<br>A: 됐어. 자, 어서 앉아! 커피도 편하게 한 잔 더 마셔.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: Warum kommst du <b>denn</b> so spät? Ich warte seit einer Stunde!<br>B: Entschuldige! Der Bus ist nicht gekommen. Das passiert <b>eben</b> manchmal.<br>A: Schon gut. Komm, setz dich <b>doch</b>! Nimm dir <b>ruhig</b> noch einen Kaffee.</div>답답한 질문 denn · 어쩔 수 없음 eben/halt · 권유 doch · 허락 ruhig예요.<br>모두 가운데 자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ruf ihn doch an!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich habe denn keine Lust.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Hast du eigentlich keine Geschwister?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Er ist ja nicht dumm.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불변화사 denn은 질문에만 써요.<br>평서문에서 '-잖아'는 ja나 doch예요 — Ich habe ja keine Lust.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe dir doch gesagt dass der Kurs heute ausfällt&quot;,&quot;Ich habe dir doch gesagt dass heute der Kurs ausfällt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">강좌가 오늘 없다고 내가 말했잖아.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">doch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">dass</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">dir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Kurs</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">ausfällt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">gesagt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe dir doch gesagt, dass der Kurs heute ausfällt.</b></div>doch는 대명사 dir 뒤에 와요.<br>dass 문장에서는 분리동사 ausfallen이 붙어서 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 'Ich komme morgen DOCH.' (doch에 강세)의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 내일 아마 갈 거예요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 내일 가잖아요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 내일 어서 와요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) (아니라고 했지만) 내일 결국 갈게요.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">불변화사는 약하게 말해요. doch에 강세가 오면 불변화사가 아니라 '그래도·결국'이라는 뜻이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"31\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 31</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"